        "original_id": "8735f255-252e-53bf-b0bc-094a7b92bc8d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carla Gugino, Tom Berenger, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje\n- Roles: Kelor\n- Films: Son in Law, Faster, Sin City, Night at the Museum, Mr. Popper's Penguins, San Andreas, The Space Between Us, Gerald's Game\n- Franchises: DC Extended Universe\n- Companies: Warner Bros.\n- Concepts: American actress, media franchise, shared universe\n\nFacts:\n- Carla Gugino was born on August 29, 1971, and she is an American actress.\n- Carla Gugino had a starring role in the film Son in Law in 1993.\n- Carla Gugino appeared in the 2010 film Faster alongside Tom Berenger, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, and Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje.\n- Carla Gugino had starring roles in Sin City in 2005 and Night at the Museum in 2006.\n- Carla Gugino had a starring role in Mr. Popper's Penguins in 2011.\n- Carla Gugino had a starring role in San Andreas in 2015.\n- Carla Gugino had starring roles in The Space Between Us and Gerald's Game in 2017.\n- Carla Gugino played Kelor in the DC Extended Universe.\n- The DC Extended Universe is an American media franchise and shared universe centered on a series of superhero films distributed by Warner Bros.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "571d7b9f-8bbb-5f8c-bf55-8aae840d87a5",
        "text": "Page: Carla Gugino. Sentence: Carla Gugino ( ; ] ; born August 29, 1971) is an American actress.\nPage: Carla Gugino. Sentence: Her feature film work includes starring roles in \"Son in Law\" (1993), \" Sin City\" (2005), \"Night at the Museum\" (2006), \"Mr. Popper's Penguins\" (2011), \"San Andreas\" (2015), \"The Space Between Us\" (2017), and \"Gerald's Game\" (2017) as well as Kelor in the DC Extended Universe.\nPage: DC Extended Universe. Sentence: The Justice League Universe (JLUDCEUUJLDCE), more commonly known by its unofficial name as the DC Extended Universe (DCEU), is an American media franchise and shared universe, centered on a series of superhero films distributed by Warner Bros.\nPage: Faster (2010 film). Sentence: Tom Berenger, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje and Carla Gugino also appear.",
